+/// TF_DS_ENGRAM_METRICS (on; `0` turns it off, as it turns the counters off): the Engram host path's clock, the
+/// hashing, the decode and the upload's wait the round keeps (round.zig's t_hash/t_decode/t_upload; not the reads).
+fn engramHostEnabled(m: *const dsv41.model.Model) bool {
+    return if (m.eh) |eh| eh.metrics else false;
